            "name": "Verify Mobile Number",
            "description": {
              "content": "This API endpoint verifies a user’s mobile phone number by confirming the one-time password (OTP) sent via SMS. The endpoint requires the phone number, the OTP received, and the token obtained from the requestMobileVerification step. Once successfully verified, the phone number is confirmed for account or seller verification purposes. Request Parameters: Name Required Type Description phone yes string The phone number to verify (same as in step 1, in E.164 format). code yes string The OTP receiv",
